# Per-Dockerfile dockerignore for docker/ci-base/Dockerfile — BuildKit uses
# this in place of the root .dockerignore for this build. The dep bake only
# needs cargo manifests + crate sources (cargo-chef prepare scans them) and
# the bun manifests for the install-cache layer.
*
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/crates/**
!/package.json
!/bun.lock
!/turbo.json
!/apps/web/package.json
!/packages/api-client/package.json
